/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117227","id":4025068652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7v6axs","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T16:34:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T16:34:07Z","body":"I will try fixing the RST generator bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4025068652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4027150517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117227#issuecomment-4027150517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117227","id":4027150517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wCXC1","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T21:53:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T05:28:34Z","body":"It turns out that RST cannot parse nested inline formatting (without using some workarounds):\r\nhttps://docutils.sourceforge.io/FAQ.html#is-nested-inline-markup-possible\r\n\r\nHere would be my \"fix\" if RST has nested inline formatting:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a1eaac8171a53e5a74cd511bc144bd28afc4c7ff/doc/tools/make_rst.py#L2282-L2283\r\n```python\r\n# New code:\r\nlink_title = text[endq_pos + 1 : endurl_pos]\r\n    for invalid_nested_tag in [\"url\"]: # Use this if RST has nested inline formatting.\r\n        if link_title.find(invalid_nested_tag) != -1:\r\n            print_error(\r\n                f\"{state.current_class}.xml: Invalid link title for [url]: found a nested {invalid_nested_tag} tag before [/url] in {context_name}.\",\r\n                state,\r\n            )\r\n            break\r\nformatted_link_title = format_text_block(link_title, context, state)\r\ntag_text = make_link(url_target, formatted_link_title)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4027150517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4028636301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117227#issuecomment-4028636301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117227","id":4028636301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wIByN","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T04:44:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T05:31:16Z","body":"Found 4 more formatting issues related to nested tags: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/11834\r\nAlso tested that all nested tags will have the same issue, e.g. `[i][b]text[/b][/i]` becomes `**text**`.\r\n\r\nI can think of 3 ways to deal with this issue:\r\n1. Remove all existing nested tags and add warnings, which is possible since currently there are only 5 problematic nested tags in the entire doc.\r\n2. Remove the inner nested tags only for RST output, which is similar to option 1, but the online doc will differ from the offline doc.\r\n3. Use [replace](https://docutils.sourceforge.io/docs/ref/rst/directives.html#replace) or [this workaround](https://silverrainz.me/blog/sphinxnotes-comboroles.html), which requires a lot of effort and still has some edge cases.\r\n\r\nMy new commit implemented option 1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4028636301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4075993174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117227#issuecomment-4075993174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117227","id":4075993174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7y8rhW","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T15:46:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T15:52:48Z","body":"I updated this line...\r\n```python\r\nif tag_depth >= 2 and debug_tag_stack[1] != \"gdscript\" and debug_tag_stack[1] != \"csharp\":\r\n```\r\n...to this line, to be more precise.\r\n```python\r\nif tag_depth > 2 or (tag_depth == 2 and not (debug_tag_stack[0] == \"codeblocks\" and (debug_tag_stack[1] == \"gdscript\" or debug_tag_stack[1] == \"csharp\"))):\r\n```\r\nNo additional issues were found after the change in existing doc files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4075993174/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113896993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117227#issuecomment-4113896993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117227","id":4113896993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71NRYh","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T21:46:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T21:46:03Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER",